    "title": "Five Elements Chess coming to Switch Sept. 29th, 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The Five Elements Match-3 Spell-Duel game, Five Elements Chess, will be released on Switch Sept. 29th, 2026. It’s developed by Candleman Games (creator of Candleman and Exhausted Man), and supports cross-platform online multiplayer. Five Elements Chess is a spell-duel game that combines the Five Elements theory and match-three gameplay.... Read full article",
